>
  <article class="content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Health Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The tools and content on Health Calculators are for general information and
      education only. They are not medical advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
    <p>
      The calculators and articles on this website do not provide medical advice,
      diagnosis, or treatment. They are intended to give general estimates based
      on published formulas. Nothing on this site should be treated as a
      substitute for the advice of a qualified healthcare professional who knows
      your individual circumstances.
    </p>

    <h2>Estimates only</h2>
    <p>
      Results are approximations generated from population-based equations. They
      cannot account for your body composition, medical conditions, medications,
      or other individual factors. Real values measured by a clinician may differ
      significantly from these estimates.
    </p>

    <h2>Always consult a professional</h2>
    <p>
      Before starting, changing, or stopping any diet, exercise, or health
      programme — or if you have any questions about a medical condition — speak
      with your doctor or another qualified healthcare provider. Never disregard
      professional medical advice or delay seeking it because of something you
      read here.
    </p>

    <h2>Emergencies</h2>
    <p>
      If you think you may have a medical emergency, contact your local emergency
      services immediately. Do not rely on this website in an emergency.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      While we aim for accuracy, we make no warranties about the completeness,
      reliability, or accuracy of the calculators or information provided. Any
      reliance you place on this material is strictly at your own risk.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      If anything here is unclear, please get in touch via our
      <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
